# Jack jumper ant

@left

![Slide image 7](assets/lect02c-genome_sizes/image_007.png)

@right

- A species of bull ant that is native to Australia.
- Fewest known chromosomes
- Females have two chromosomes (diploid)
- Male have only one (haploid)
  - (XO system)

